# Bot2 activates Abandoned Air Temple's "{3}{W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control" on turn four.
# Bot1 flashes in Tishana's Tidebinder off a Black Lotus and counters it, so the Mother of Runes gets no counter.
# The Temple is a land, not an artifact, creature or planeswalker, so it does not lose its abilities: on turn six,
# with the Tidebinder still on the battlefield, Bot2 taps the Temple for {W} with its own mana ability.

